WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.029 --> 00:00:11.820
I've decided to engage the services of a painter.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.048
Put your brush to capturing my wife.

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:17.240
She's a rare beauty.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.400
May I?

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.280
Don't move.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.340
You've caught her beauty, sir,

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:28.620
as well as her innocence and purity.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.800
You've stolen my heart.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.420
And you've stolen mine.

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:34.980
I could take you away.

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:36.720
He would find us.

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:39.760
He would not stop looking for me unless I was dead.

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:46.680
Lord, I pray that my wife shall be not a
corruptible seed but of incorruptible.

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:48.760
What is it?

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:50.400
I'm going to have a baby.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:52.540
If you throw me out, I'll tell your
husband what you've been up to.

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:56.220
You've been busy, but not painting.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:01.709
First to flower, first to fall.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:05.460
What's the matter?

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:06.720
She knows about us.

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:08.300
What am I gonna do?

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:09.600
I made a plan to save us both.

00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:12.820
Are you mad?

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:14.172
You must trust me.

00:01:14.172 --> 00:01:16.349
If we sink, we sink together.

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:20.550
There's nothing without risk.

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:21.900
What have I done?

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:25.860
Never underestimate God if it gets nothing.

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:27.440
I must find her.

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:28.920
Sophia!

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:31.460
You two really think you'll carry this off?

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:32.960
We will be together.

